DESCRIPTION:GO Wild Area returns in 2026 with Steel- and Dragon-type Poké
 mon\, the debuts of Gigantamax Duraludon\, Dynamax Dialga\, and Dynamax Pa
 lkia\, and powerful mighty Pokémon. Collect GO Safari Balls to help catch
  these challenging encounters!\n\nDates:November 6\, 7\, or 8\, 2026Time:1
 0:00 a.m. – 6:00 p.m. JST (UTC+9)Location:Sendai\, Japan\, with gameplay
  throughout Miyagi PrefectureTicket:¥4\,000 (including applicable taxes a
 nd fees) for one day\n\nAll event gameplay is exclusive to ticket holders.
 A standard ticket covers one selected day\; Extra Day add-ons extend eligi
 ble gameplay to additional days. Gameplay is available only within the eve
 nt area at the date and time specified on your ticket.\n\nTicket registrat
 ion:Register fromSeptember 11 at 8:00 a.m. JST through September 15\, 2026
 \, at 7:59 a.m. JST. Registered Trainers will be notified of their purchas
 e window afterward. Tickets are first come\, first served\, and registrati
 on does not guarantee availability.Read the ticket registration announceme
 nt.\n\nMore info: https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-se
 ndai-japan/\n\nData from LeekDuck.com
LOCATION:Pokemon GO
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-go-wild-area-2026-sendai-japan/
